## Installing

1. Install [MelonLoader](https://melonwiki.xyz) for Schedule I.
2. Copy `{{Pascal}}.dll` into the game's `Mods` folder.
3. Start the game.

There is a build for each branch of the game (Mono and IL2CPP). Use the one that matches your install.

